    "summary": "In [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE** model of yours up to 3\" from this model can be picked; no model can be picked for this ability more than once per turn. The picked model:\n\n- regains as many as D3 lost wounds\n- gets +1 to Hit on its attacks until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase)",
